            "review_title": "Review at Pho Nuong Tokyo BBQ & Beer Chanh Nghia",
            "review_text": "planetosee\nLeicester, United Kingdom54 contributions\n1\nMy favourite place in Thu Dau Mot\nOct 2020\nI can't believe there are only two (three now) reviews of this place?! It's probably one of the most popular places around.\nAlways a great atmosphere, and we try to visit at least three times a month.\n\nThe beer (ice cold Sapporo) is really cheap and the do it yourself BBQ is great, with a fantastic selection of foods to try. The chili salted crocodile is delicious.\n\nGive it a try - you won't be disappointed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 5, 2020",
